-- examples/checks/budget-wall.rofl — A WORLD THAT RUNS OUT.
-- Six facts crossed three ways is 216 tuples; declared with a budget that
-- cannot reach them, the kernel stops and says so rather than answering a
-- partial world as if it were whole. The `hole` it records IS the golden.
q(1). q(2). q(3). q(4). q(5). q(6).
tri(X, Y, Z) :- q(X), q(Y), q(Z).
